OL,3,AHarry says he wants to 'reconcile' with
OL,4,Ahis family
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke of Sussex has said he wants to
OL,7,Frepair his complicated relationships
OL,8,Fwith his father and brother, in a
OL,9,Fmagazine interview.
OL,11,F"Some people don't want it to work out.
OL,12,FI want it to work out. With everything
OL,13,Felse that's going on in the world, the
OL,14,Fmost important thing is to reconcile -
OL,15,Fthat's the key point," Prince Harry
OL,16,Ftold GQ in New York.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
