OL,3,AHarry says he wants to 'reconcile' with
OL,4,Ahis family
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Scars stick around forever. But what
OL,7,Fyour perception is, and what your
OL,8,Fmindset is to those things that have
OL,9,Fhappened, letting go of the past,
OL,10,Fthat's something that I would encourage
OL,11,Feverybody to do," said Prince Harry.
OL,13,FLast week Prince Harry and Meghan
OL,14,Fcarried out their first public
OL,15,Fengagement together since their return
OL,16,Fto the UK in the summer.
